      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Anil Seth argues that popular claims of conscious AI rest on psychological biases and a flawed computational theory of mind, so we should resist both creating and mistakenly believing in machine consciousness.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
